                            <a name="comment2880"></a>
<h4 class="boldbyline">
Re: So Long, Mr. Whipple
</h4>

<p>
Loved this story! Great details -- I didn't know toilet paper had gotten "fatter" throughout the decades, but it's not surprising. And I'm not really good with pop culture. Does Oprah really talk about her poo on TV? <br />
<br />
So... poo is an okay subject now? Or not -- as evidenced with the frolicking bears and their tree-mounted TP. <br />
<br />
As a girl with ulcerative colitis... if the subject is cool now, y'all just let me know. <br />
<br />
Hank, great story! <br />
<br />
Erin :) 
</p>
<div class="posted">Posted by:


